'''Futunyan''' (ふてニャン, ''Fute Nyan'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Y! Mobile Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Futenyan
|image = E 269.png
|appearance = [[Y! Mobile Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 300円 - 1,185円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is very weak, having pathetic health and a long attack rate. Futenyan's [[Area Attack]] doesn't matter to much due to the aforementioned reasons, and this enemy also has quite a high money drop for its stats. Overall, treat it like a weaker [[Hippoe]].

==Strategy==
Use anything to defeat it and it will most likely die in one hit anyway.

